# The Headlamp this repo's image is built from. Editing this file rebuilds the image.
# HEADLAMP_REPO must be public. HEADLAMP_TAG is the image tag published to
# ghcr.io/risingtidegroup/headlamp (it moves with each build; a pinned
# <tag>-<headlamp sha7>-<plugins sha7> tag is published alongside).
#
# rtg/main = upstream Headlamp main (unreleased) + Rising Tide's fixes:
#   - /me resolves non-JWT tokens (DigitalOcean's) with a SelfSubjectReview
#   - proxied request bodies are replayable, so writes survive an HTTP/2 GOAWAY
#   - the final image applies pending Alpine security updates
# Because it is unreleased code, the workflow runs Headlamp's backend tests,
# starts the image, and Trivy-scans it before anything is published.
HEADLAMP_REPO=RisingTideGroup/headlamp
HEADLAMP_REF=rtg/main
HEADLAMP_TAG=rtg-main
